### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products

### Get single product
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/milano-blazer

### Get all wilayas
GET http://localhost:3001/api/wilayas

### Place order
POST http://localhost:3001/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {
    "name": "Yacine Ouali",
    "phone": "+213555123456"
  },
  "delivery": {
    "wilaya": "Sétif",
    "wilaya_code": 19,
    "commune": "El Eulma",
    "address": "15 Rue des Frères Bouaziz"
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": null,
      "name": "Milano Blazer",
      "size": "M",
      "qty": 1,
      "price": 8900
    }
  ]
}

### Track order (replace LRZ-XXXXXXXX-XXXX with actual number)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/orders/LRZ-20260530-0001
